tutorial-single-device-spy-game =
    📝 <b>How to play</b>

    One player is secretly chosen as the Spy, while the rest are citizens who share a hidden word. Citizens ask and answer questions to identify the spy, while the spy must blend in and try to guess the word.

    Before the game starts, each player takes turns viewing their role:
    Tap <b>«View role»</b>, privately check your role and (if you are a citizen) the secret word, then tap <b>«Proceed»</b> and pass the phone to the next player.

    Continue until everyone has checked their role and the phone returns to the starting player, completing the circle. Then the game begins.
tutorial-single-device-impostor-game =
   📝 <b>How to play</b>

    In this game, one or more players are secretly chosen as impostors. Each player receives a question — but not everyone gets the same one.

    Everyone must answer their question without knowing whether it is the real one or the impostor version. After all answers are submitted, the real question is revealed and players compare responses.

    Before the game begins, each player takes turns:
    Tap <b>«View question»</b>, read your question privately, type your answer, then tap <b>«Proceed»</b> and pass the phone to the next player.

    Continue until everyone has answered and the phone returns to the starting player, completing the circle. Then the answers are revealed and the discussion begins.
